<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Happy First Month 🤍</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

</head>


<body>


<audio id="song" loop>
    <source src="music/lagu.mp3" type="audio/mp3">
</audio>



<section id="home" class="page active">

<h1>Happy First Month 🤍</h1>

<p>
21 — our first chapter
</p>

<button onclick="start()">
Start our story ✨
</button>

</section>





<section id="collect" class="page">


<h2>Collect My Love 🤍</h2>

<p>
Collect 10 love to unlock your letter
</p>


<div class="love-count">
❤️ <span id="count">0</span>/10
</div>



<div id="basket">
🧺
</div>



<div id="love-area"></div>


</section>





<section id="memory" class="page">


<h2>
Our Memories 📸
</h2>


<div class="photos">


<img src="images/foto1.jpg">

<img src="images/foto2.jpg">

<img src="images/foto3.jpg">


</div>


</section>






<section id="letter" class="page">


<div class="envelope" onclick="openLetter()">

💌

<p>
Tap to open
</p>

</div>



<div id="textLetter">


<h2>
For You, Sayang 🤍
</h2>


<p>

happy first month, sayang. 🤍

selamat buat tanggal 21 kita yang pertama. honestly, aku masih ngerasa semuanya cepet banget. rasanya baru kemarin kita mulai kenal lebih deket, eh sekarang udah ada di titik ini.

makasih ya udah hadir di hidup aku. makasih juga udah selalu nyempetin waktu, dengerin cerita-cerita random aku, dan bikin hari-hari biasa jadi lebih seru.

you probably don't realize it, but those little things really mean a lot to me.

aku tau ini baru satu bulan. we're still learning about each other.

semoga kita tetap bisa komunikasi, saling ngerti, dan tetap milih buat stay.

once again, thank you ya, sayang.

happy first month.
i'm really glad it's you. 🤍


</p>


</div>


</section>






<script src="script.js"></script>


</body>
</html>
